From 0ca163ece036853d3083f0d46c9067b76e9ecff6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jon <jon@local>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 09:04:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] feat(push): built-in Feishu/Bark/PushDeer sinks via
 shared Ray.BiliBiliTool.Push

Self-authored batched HTTP push sink (10s batch, sync flush on dispose, silent
when unconfigured) plus FeishuPush / BarkPush / PushDeerPush extensions, moved
into a shared class library referenced by both Web and Console hosts. Registered
in Serilog:Using and WriteTo:13/14/15 (with default server/endpoint); the Web
host's message-push page automatically renders these three channels.
